 "notes": [
  "Every enabled label must have a commodity-map.json entry for the same productSlug (checked by the script). Entries with verified false are stored as validation_status=unverified_mapping, hidden from default reads, and counted as storedUnverifiedMapping.",
  "Labels differ between the current-daily and variety-wise resources and over time (for example Paddy(Dhan)(Common) before about March 2026 and Paddy(Common) after). Run a label census (--dates ... --no-store) and review the unmatched-label report before the full pull; add any alias to commodity-map.json and to the matching product here.",
  "Prices are stored in the source unit INR/quintal under the existing Agmarknet convention assumption flag; INR/kg is derived by the shared normaliser.",
  "available_at is the fetch time per page (flag availability_basis:conservative_upper_bound): the source publishes no first-seen time, as in the ginger pull."
 ]
}
